<h2 id="bosses">How a boss works</h2>
<p>Each boss has a health bar measured in hours of coding. Every time someone ships a project, its hours hit the boss, so ship together to defeat it.</p>
<div class="alert" role="note"><p>Coding alone never hurts the boss. Shipping does.</p></div>
<ul>
  <li>Damage is the coded hours on the ships people submitted during the boss&rsquo;s week. A boss week runs from Friday 00:00 UTC to the next Friday 00:00 UTC.</li>
  <li>A ship that is waiting for review or approved counts. A rejected or withdrawn ship does not. If staff approve fewer hours than you coded, the damage uses the approved hours.</li>
  <li>Once a boss is defeated, it stays defeated.</li>
</ul>
